# Atmosphere Overlay

`CrtOverlay` renders a soft vignette only. Scanlines, flicker, and phosphor bloom were removed for a cleaner dark SaaS look.

- Mounted from `Layout.tsx` on all routes except `/press`
- Styles live in `src/styles/crt-overlay.css`
- Do not reintroduce scanline/flicker animations without an explicit design decision
